          <div class="osx-lower-card">
            <div class="osx-flock-head">
              <div class="osx-flock-title">🐑 Where's the <span class="osx-flock-grad">flock?</span></div>
              <div class="osx-flock-sub">Creators building right alongside you. Tap any pin to meet the maker behind it. 📍</div>
            </div>
            <div class="osx-mb-map osx-members-map" data-members-map></div>
            <p class="osx-mb-mapnote">Pins are approximate (city‑level) — never your exact address.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="osx-suggest" data-suggest>
            <div class="osx-suggest-h">💡 Help us be better</div>
            <p class="osx-suggest-sub">A question, an idea, or a bit of praise? Send it straight to the team — it comes to us privately, not to the community.</p>
            <select class="osx-suggest-kind" data-suggest-kind>
              <option value="Suggestion">Suggestion</option>
              <option value="Question">Question</option>
              <option value="Kudos">Kudos / Praise</option>
              <option value="Report">Report a concern</option>
            </select>
            <textarea class="osx-cw-text" data-suggest-text maxlength="2000" rows="3" placeholder="Share your thoughts…"></textarea>
            <div class="osx-suggest-row"><span class="osx-suggest-status" data-suggest-status></span><button class="osx-cw-postbtn" type="button" data-suggest-send>Send</button></div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} ===== VIEW: Tools & Resources (a hub of real destinations) ===== {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign tools_journey_url = section.settings.journey_url | default: '/pages/p2p-learning' -%}
    {%- assign tools_tutorial_url = section.settings.tools_tutorial_url | default: '/pages/p2p-tutorial' -%}
    {%- assign tools_badges_url = section.settings.tools_badges_url | default: '/pages/p2p-learning-badges' -%}
    {%- assign os_support_email = section.settings.support_email | default: 'Hello@blacksheepcreations.com' -%}
    <section class="osx-view" data-view="tools">
      <div class="osx-kick">Tools &amp; Resources</div>
      <h2 class="osx-h2">{{ section.settings.tools_title | default: 'Everything, one click away' }}</h2>
      <p class="osx-lede">{{ section.settings.tools_intro | default: "The handy bits that keep you moving — how the OS works, where your journey lives, and quick jumps to the tools you'll reach for most." }}</p>

      <div class="osx-resgroup">
        <div class="osx-reslabel">Find your way around</div>
        <div class="osx-resgrid">
          <a class="osx-rescard" href="{{ tools_tutorial_url }}"><span class="osx-resic">🧭</span><b>Guided walkthrough</b><span>See how the whole OS works, step by step.</span><i>→</i></a>
          <a class="osx-rescard" href="{{ tools_journey_url }}"><span class="osx-resic">🗺️</span><b>Your Learning Journey</b><span>The gamified course map — realms, courses, badges.</span><i>→</i></a>
          <a class="osx-rescard" href="{{ tools_badges_url }}"><span class="osx-resic">🏅</span><b>Badges &amp; milestones</b><span>Everything you've earned, and what's next.</span><i>→</i></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="osx-resgroup">
        <div class="osx-reslabel">Work faster</div>
        <div class="osx-resgrid">
          <button class="osx-rescard" type="button" data-osx-goto="mates"><span class="osx-resic">🤝</span><b>Your Haus Mates</b><span>Frank &amp; Ruth — brainstorm and build on demand.</span><i>→</i></button>
          <button class="osx-rescard" type="button" data-osx-goto="notebook"><span class="osx-resic">📓</span><b>Your Notebook</b><span>Ideas, notes, wins &amp; journal — all in one place.</span><i>→</i></button>
          <button class="osx-rescard" type="button" data-osx-goto="checkpoint"><span class="osx-resic">✅</span><b>Daily Checkpoint</b><span>A quick set-up so every visit moves you forward.</span><i>→</i></button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="osx-resgroup">
        <div class="osx-reslabel">Get better results</div>
        <div class="osx-restips">
          <details><summary>How do I get better output from any generator?</summary><div class="osx-fa"><p>Be specific, name who it's for, and show an example of what &ldquo;good&rdquo; looks like. Three small concrete details beat a long vague paragraph every time.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>What order should I work in?</summary><div class="osx-fa"><p>Top to bottom down the sidebar: find your direction, lock your Brand DNA, then Content, Graphics, Project, Marketing — and launch with ROOTED. Each step feeds the next.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>Where does my work get saved?</summary><div class="osx-fa"><p>Your brand kit and progress live in your account and this browser. Sign in on any device to pick up where you left off, and use each Haus's Export button to keep your own copy.</p></div></details>
        </div>
        <div class="osx-ressupport">
          <span class="osx-ressupport-ic">✉️</span>
          <div>Stuck on something? <a href="mailto:{{ os_support_email }}">Email {{ os_support_email }} →</a><br><small>Tell us your account email and what you were doing, and we'll get you sorted.</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} ===== VIEW: Bonus Resources (downloadable freebies — PDFs) ===== {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="osx-view" data-view="bonus">
      <div class="osx-kick">Bonus Resources</div>
      <h2 class="osx-h2">{{ section.settings.bonus_title | default: 'Free downloads, just for you' }}</h2>
      <p class="osx-lede">{{ section.settings.bonus_intro | default: "Guides, checklists and templates to download and keep. New drops are added regularly — grab whatever helps." }}</p>

      {%- comment -%} Baked freebies (revert-proof): one per line (| separated), fields ^ separated:
         title^description^download-url^type-label^thumbnail-asset-filename.
         Thumbnail is an assets/ filename (resolved with asset_url); leave blank for a 📄 icon. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- capture os_bonus -%}Journal Creator Quickstart Series — Vol. 1^Turn a broad journal thought into one clear concept you're ready to build.^https://canva.link/vol-1-journal-creator-series^eBook^bonus-journal-creator-vol1.jpg{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- assign os_bonus_clean = os_bonus | strip -%}
      {%- assign bonus_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'bonus' -%}

      {%- if os_bonus_clean != blank or bonus_blocks.size > 0 -%}
        <div class="osx-bonusgrid">
          {%- if os_bonus_clean != blank -%}
            {%- assign os_bonus_items = os_bonus_clean | split: '|' -%}
            {%- for bo in os_bonus_items -%}
              {%- assign bf = bo | split: '^' -%}
              <a class="osx-bonuscard" href="{{ bf[2] }}" download target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                {%- if bf[4] != blank -%}
                  <span class="osx-bonus-thumb"><img src="{{ bf[4] | asset_url }}" alt="{{ bf[0] | escape }}" loading="lazy"></span>
                {%- else -%}
                  <span class="osx-bonus-thumb osx-bonus-thumb--ic">📄</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                <span class="osx-bonus-type">{{ bf[3] | default: 'PDF' }}</span>
                <b>{{ bf[0] }}</b>
                {%- if bf[1] != blank -%}<span class="osx-bonus-desc">{{ bf[1] }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                <span class="osx-bonus-dl">Download <i>↓</i></span>
              </a>
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- for b in bonus_blocks -%}
            <a class="osx-bonuscard" href="{{ b.settings.file_url | default: '#' }}" download target="_blank" rel="noopener" {{ b.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- if b.settings.thumb != blank -%}
                <span class="osx-bonus-thumb"><img src="{{ b.settings.thumb | image_url: width: 600 }}" alt="{{ b.settings.title | escape }}" loading="lazy"></span>
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="osx-bonus-thumb osx-bonus-thumb--ic">📄</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="osx-bonus-type">{{ b.settings.badge | default: 'PDF' }}</span>
              <b>{{ b.settings.title | default: 'Free download' }}</b>
              {%- if b.settings.desc != blank -%}<span class="osx-bonus-desc">{{ b.settings.desc }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              <span class="osx-bonus-dl">Download <i>↓</i></span>
            </a>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="osx-bonus-empty">
          <div class="osx-bonus-empty-ic">🎁</div>
          <b>Fresh freebies are on the way</b>
          <p>Downloadable guides, checklists and templates will land right here. Check back soon — new drops are added regularly.</p>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} ===== generic placeholder + embed frame ===== {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="osx-view" data-view="__placeholder">
      <div class="osx-ph"><div class="osx-ph-ic">✦</div><h2 data-osx-ph-title>Coming together</h2><p>This part of your OS is being built. Check back very soon.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="osx-view" data-view="__locked">
      <div class="osx-ph"><div class="osx-ph-ic">🔒</div><h2 data-osx-lock-title>Locked</h2><p>You don't have access to this yet.</p><a class="osx-cta as-link" data-osx-get href="#">Get access →</a></div>
    </section>
    <iframe class="osx-frame" data-osx-frame title="Tool" hidden></iframe>
  </main>
{%- else -%}
  {%- comment -%} Non-members: preview splash instead of the members' shell {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="osx-gate">
    <div class="osx-gate-in">
      <img class="osx-gate-mark" src="{{ 'p2p-brand-mark.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Purpose 2 Profit" loading="eager">
      <span class="osx-gate-eyebrow">Purpose 2 Profit · Your Operating System</span>
      <h1 class="osx-gate-h1">Your Haus is waiting</h1>
      <p class="osx-gate-tag">{{ section.settings.hero_brand_tagline | default: 'Where Your originality is rooted and ready to grow.' }}</p>
      <p class="osx-gate-body">This is your members' home base — your Brand DNA, all six Hausen, your two AI partners, the Learning Journey and the launch method, all in one place. Take a look inside, then make it yours.</p>
      <div class="osx-gate-btns">
        <a class="osx-gate-btn primary" href="{{ section.settings.gate_preview_url | default: '/pages/p2p-os-preview' }}">See what's inside →</a>
        <a class="osx-gate-btn ghost" href="{{ section.settings.gate_access_url | default: '/products/p2p-os-access' }}">Get the Access Pass</a>
      </div>
      <a class="osx-gate-login" href="/account/login">Already a member? Log in →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
</div>

{%- comment -%} Rule-based guided help widget (floating). Add to haus-links.liquid to put it site-wide. {%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'p2p-helper' %}

<style>
  #p2pos.osx{--text:#e7efeb;--muted:#8aa0a6;--gold:#c9a24a;--gold-bright:#f4c534;--stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.09);--gstroke:rgba(216,180,90,.38);
    --panel:#0b1620;--side:#081119;--emerald:#27ae6e;--teal:#39c5c0;--aurora:linear-gradient(100deg,#f4e2a6,#8f6fd6,#27ae6e,#39c5c0,#2563eb,#d6336c,#f4e2a6);
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:264px 1fr;gap:0;min-height:80vh;color:var(--text);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
    background:radial-gradient(120% 80% at 0% 0%,#0d1a26,#050a10);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;}
  @keyframes p2pos-shift{0%{background-position:0% 50%;}100%{background-position:300% 50%;}}
  #p2pos .osx-2{background:var(--aurora);background-size:300% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;animation:p2pos-shift 20s linear infinite;font-style:italic;}
  #p2pos .osx-burger{display:none;}

  /* sidebar */
  #p2pos .osx-side{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--side),#060d14);border-right:1px solid var(--stroke);padding:22px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-height:88vh;overflow-y:auto;}
  #p2pos .osx-brand{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--stroke);padding:6px 10px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;transition:background .15s;}
  #p2pos .osx-brand:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);}
  #p2pos .osx-brandmark{font:700 19px/1.1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:.01em;color:var(--text);}
  #p2pos .osx-brandsub{margin-top:5px;font:600 9.5px/1.3 system-ui;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);}
  #p2pos .osx-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;}
  #p2pos .osx-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;width:100%;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:11px;background:none;color:#cdd9dd;font:600 13.5px/1.2 system-ui;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;}
  #p2pos .osx-item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);color:var(--text);}
  #p2pos .osx-item.on{background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(216,180,90,.16),rgba(143,111,214,.12));border-color:var(--gstroke);color:#fff;}
  #p2pos .osx-ico{flex:0 0 20px;height:20px;display:grid;place-items:center;}
  #p2pos .osx-ico svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:var(--gold-bright);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}
  #p2pos .osx-item.locked .osx-ico svg{stroke:var(--muted);}
  #p2pos .osx-lbl{flex:1;min-width:0;}
  #p2pos .osx-lock{font-size:11px;opacity:.7;}

  /* main pane */
  #p2pos .osx-main{position:relative;overflow-y:auto;max-height:88vh;}
  #p2pos .osx-view{display:none;padding:30px 34px 44px;}
  #p2pos .osx-view.on{display:block;}
  #p2pos .osx-frame{width:100%;height:88vh;border:0;background:#0b1620;}

  /* hero */
  #p2pos .osx-hero{position:relative;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;padding:44px 36px;margin-bottom:24px;
    display:flex;gap:30px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(143,111,214,.16),rgba(57,197,192,.08)),#0a141c;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero[style*="--hero"]{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,10,16,.55),rgba(5,10,16,.82)),var(--hero) center/cover no-repeat;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-glow{position:absolute;inset:-40% -10% auto -10%;height:60%;background:radial-gradient(50% 100% at 30% 0%,rgba(143,111,214,.5),transparent 70%),radial-gradient(50% 100% at 75% 10%,rgba(57,197,192,.4),transparent 70%);filter:blur(20px);opacity:.6;pointer-events:none;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-in{position:relative;flex:1;min-width:280px;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-lockup{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin-bottom:2px;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-head{min-width:0;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-mark{height:clamp(88px,11vw,142px);width:auto;flex:none;display:block;
    filter:drop-shadow(0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.9)) drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,.4)) drop-shadow(0 8px 20px rgba(120,80,220,.35));}
  @media (max-width:560px){#p2pos .osx-hero-lockup{gap:12px;} #p2pos .osx-hero-mark{height:88px;}}
  /* non-member preview gate */
  #p2pos .osx-gate{min-height:70vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:52px 20px;
    background:radial-gradient(46% 40% at 12% 4%,rgba(39,174,110,.14),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(42% 36% at 88% 8%,rgba(37,99,235,.12),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(50% 40% at 60% 100%,rgba(214,51,108,.10),transparent 60%),linear-gradient(180deg,#080d0b,#0a1310 50%,#080d0b);}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-in{max-width:560px;text-align:center;}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-mark{height:clamp(120px,26vw,196px);width:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto 18px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,.85)) drop-shadow(0 0 14px rgba(255,255,255,.38)) drop-shadow(0 14px 34px rgba(120,80,220,.4));}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-eyebrow{display:inline-block;font:700 12px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7fe3b8;margin-bottom:14px;}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-h1{font:800 clamp(30px,6vw,46px)/1.05 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--text);}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-tag{font:italic 600 clamp(15px,2.4vw,19px)/1.4 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 18px;
    background:var(--aurora);background-size:300% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;animation:p2pos-shift 26s linear infinite;}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-body{font:400 15.5px/1.65 system-ui;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 26px;}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:16px;}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;font:700 15px/1 system-ui;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .14s,filter .14s;}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-btn.primary{color:#0a1410;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#f4e2a6,#c9a24a);box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(216,180,90,.6);}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-btn.ghost{color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--gstroke);}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);filter:brightness(1.04);}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-login{display:inline-block;font:600 13px/1 system-ui;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;}
  #p2pos .osx-gate-login:hover{color:var(--text);}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){#p2pos .osx-gate-tag{animation:none;}}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-tagline{margin:10px 0 0;font:italic 600 clamp(14px,2vw,17px)/1.4 Georgia,serif;
    background:var(--aurora);background-size:300% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;animation:p2pos-shift 26s linear infinite;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){#p2pos .osx-hero-tagline{animation:none;}}
  /* personalized Brand DNA panel */
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna{position:relative;flex:0 0 360px;max-width:400px;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna.is-result{border:1px solid var(--gstroke);border-radius:18px;padding:16px;background:rgba(5,10,16,.5);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-img{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/3;margin-bottom:12px;border:1px solid var(--stroke);}
  /* archetypes whose art has an opaque black background (couldn't be cut out) sit on black so they blend */
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-img--onblack{background:#000;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-kick{font:700 10px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:6px;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-name{font:700 22px/1.1 Georgia,serif;background:var(--aurora);background-size:300% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;animation:p2pos-shift 20s linear infinite;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-word{font:800 11px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-bright);margin-top:5px;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-traits{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:11px;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-trait{font:600 10.5px/1 system-ui;color:#dbe7e2;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:20px;padding:6px 10px;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;font:700 11.5px/1 system-ui;color:var(--gold-bright);text-decoration:none;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-link:hover{text-decoration:underline;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-nudge{display:block;padding:20px 18px;border:1px dashed var(--gstroke);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(216,180,90,.06);text-decoration:none;text-align:center;transition:background .15s;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-nudge:hover{background:rgba(216,180,90,.12);}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-nudge-ic{display:block;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--gold-bright);}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-nudge b{display:block;font:700 15px/1.2 Georgia,serif;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px;}
  #p2pos .osx-hero-dna .dna-nudge-sub{display:block;font:500 12px/1.4 system-ui;color:var(--muted);}
  @media (max-width:760px){#p2pos .osx-hero-dna{flex:1 1 100%;max-width:none;}}
  /* daily Mindset · Purpose · Heart carousel */
  #p2pos .osx-moments{margin-top:12px;border:1px solid var(--gstroke);border-radius:12px;padding:9px 13px;background:rgba(5,10,16,.45);max-width:520px;}
  #p2pos .mo-title{font:700 9.5px/1.2 system-ui;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:4px;}
  #p2pos .mo-star{color:var(--gold-bright);}
  #p2pos .mo-grad{background:var(--aurora);background-size:300% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;animation:p2pos-shift 20s linear infinite;}
  #p2pos .mo-text{font:italic 400 13px/1.4 Georgia,serif;color:var(--text);margin:0 0 3px;min-height:1.4em;}
  #p2pos .mo-source{font:600 11px/1.3 system-ui;color:var(--muted);font-style:normal;}
  #p2pos .mo-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:6px;}
  #p2pos .mo-dots{display:flex;gap:7px;}
  #p2pos .mo-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;border:0;padding:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.22);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,transform .15s;}
  #p2pos .mo-dot.on{background:var(--gold-bright);transform:scale(1.25);}
  #p2pos .mo-dot:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.42);}
  #p2pos .mo-next{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--stroke);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);color:var(--gold-bright);font:700 18px/1 system-ui;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;display:grid;place-items:center;}
  #p2pos .mo-next:hover{border-color:var(--gstroke);background:rgba(216,180,90,.1);}
